# Ordeal of Nylea: "Whenever enchanted creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it. Then if it has three or more +1/+1 counters on it, sacrifice this Aura. When you sacrifice this Aura,
# search ..." (CR 508.1m, 122.1, 701.21a, 603.10a). Bot1's Elvish Mystic attacks three times: the first two attacks leave the Aura on it with one and two counters; at the third it has three
# counters, the Aura is sacrificed, and Bot1 searches for two basic lands, which arrive tapped (a creature card and a third land are not allowed).

